{
  "name": "ir_get_documents",
  "implementation": "sajha.tools.impl.investor_relations_tool_refactored.IRGetDocumentsTool",
  "description": "Investor relations documents of a supported company (reports, presentations, proxies, press releases, ESG), by type and year.\nReturns {ticker, document_type, year, count, documents: [{title, url, type, year, quarter, date, description, ticker, is_pdf, context}], success}, newest first.\nInputs (* required): ticker* (string, stock symbol such as AAPL or MSFT; case-insensitive), document_type (annual_report | quarterly_report | earnings_presentation | investor_presentation | proxy_statement | press_release | esg_report | all; default all), year (integer 2000-2030), limit (integer 1-50, default 10).\nScrapes the company's IR site; falls back to SEC EDGAR filings when that finds nothing and a CIK is known. Only tickers in SAJHA's built-in company list work (ir_list_supported_companies); others fail with 'not supported'. Narrower: ir_get_annual_reports, ir_get_presentations.\nExample: {\"ticker\": \"AAPL\", \"document_type\": \"annual_report\", \"limit\": 5}",
  "version": "2.9.8",
  "enabled": true,
  "inputSchema": {
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {
      "ticker": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "Stock ticker symbol"
      },
      "document_type": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "Type of document to retrieve",
        "enum": [
          "annual_report",
          "quarterly_report",
          "earnings_presentation",
          "investor_presentation",
          "proxy_statement",
          "press_release",
          "esg_report",
          "all"
        ],
        "default": "all"
      },
      "year": {
        "type": "integer",
        "description": "Filter by specific year (optional)",
        "minimum": 2000,
        "maximum": 2030
      },
      "limit": {
        "type": "integer",
        "description": "Maximum number of documents to return",
        "default": 10,
        "minimum": 1,
        "maximum": 50
      }
    },
    "required": ["ticker"]
  },
  "outputSchema": {
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {
      "ticker": {"type": "string"},
      "document_type": {"type": "string"},
      "year": {"type": ["integer", "null"]},
      "count": {"type": "integer"},
      "documents": {
        "type": "array",
        "items": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "title": {"type": "string"},
            "url": {"type": "string"},
            "date": {"type": "string"},
            "type": {"type": "string"}
          }
        }
      },
      "success": {"type": "boolean"}
    }
  },
  "metadata": {
    "author": "Ashutosh Sinha",
    "category": "Financial Analysis",
    "tags": ["investor relations", "documents", "reports", "filings"],
    "rateLimit": 30,
    "cacheTTL": 3600,
    "supported_companies": ["TSLA", "MSFT", "C", "BMO", "RY", "JPM", "GS"],
    "examples": [
      {
        "description": "Get all Tesla annual reports",
        "input": {
          "ticker": "TSLA",
          "document_type": "annual_report"
        }
      },
      {
        "description": "Get Microsoft's 2024 earnings presentations",
        "input": {
          "ticker": "MSFT",
          "document_type": "earnings_presentation",
          "year": 2024
        }
      }
    ],
    "useCases": [
      "Research company filings",
      "Retrieve specific document types",
      "Historical document analysis"
    ]
  }
}
